    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Archiving is a VIEW, not a third way out",
      "prov:value": "The owner ruled it 2026-09-26 (bean `e8m3`): an archived bean **keeps its status** and is still part of the store, moved aside rather than closed.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `e8m3`",
        "owner",
        "2026-09-26"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Archiving is a VIEW, not a third way out",
      "prov:value": "**Closing is governed by evidence, not by authorship**, and this paragraph used to say the opposite."
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Claims are global via the state branch store (formerly branch-local)",
      "prov:value": "Historically, claims were commits to `beans/defs/<bean>.md` on feature branches, meaning a claim only announced rather than reserved until a PR opened."
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "proposal",
      "cat-harness:section": "Claims are global via the state branch store (formerly branch-local)",
      "prov:value": "Under the state branch architecture (proposal `state-branch-2026-10-02.md`), **claims are pushed immediately to the branch store**",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "proposal `",
        "2026-10-02"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "Claims are global via the state branch store (formerly branch-local)",
      "prov:value": "`beans:claim` writes one copy and reads status only, and on 2026-10-24 that let two agents start f1e1 minutes apart.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-24"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A DECISION bean you will not land soon — put the question where a person reads",
      "prov:value": "Bean `r0tm` carried a recommendation and a safe default on a branch with no PR, which is exactly the shape that goes unseen. It was answered, and it was answered because the question had been posted to [issue #1558](https://github.com/litlfred/folio-assistant/issues/1558) and PR #1581 — not because anyone found the bean.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "Bean `r0tm`",
        "#1558",
        "issues/1558",
        "#1581",
        "PR #1581"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "A DECISION bean you will not land soon — put the question where a person reads",
      "prov:value": "- **`status: draft` in front matter is the marker — claimed 2026-10-01, on the owner's ruling.**",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "owner's",
        "2026-10-01"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-01"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-8",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A DECISION bean you will not land soon — put the question where a person reads",
      "prov:value": "Six recognisers over the open beans give between **1 and 190** candidates depending which form you match (`Recommendation` heading 1, `Options` heading 20, `safe default` 1, `ruling` 63, `owner's call` 48, an unticked box 190) — bean `vq8g` as a number rather than a worry.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `vq8g`",
        "owner's"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-9",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A DECISION bean you will not land soon — put the question where a person reads",
      "prov:value": "The comment and the line are what reach a human; the front-matter status is what lets `bun run cat check:draft-beans` (`scripts/check-draft-beans.ts`) find any ruling request that never landed, reporting with a denominator (`dh4f`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "`dh4f`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-10",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The trigger is STARTING WORK, not claiming — and that distinction cost a merge",
      "prov:value": "**Measured 2026-09-26, bean `tuvg`.**",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `tuvg`",
        "2026-09-26"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-11",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The trigger is STARTING WORK, not claiming — and that distinction cost a merge",
      "prov:value": "A session already held `tuvg` and was executing an owner instruction on one cause inside it. Sibling PR **#1381 was open and doing the identical work** — 25 `UNCATALOGED` records — and a `--search` for it would have returned it in one call.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "`tuvg`",
        "owner",
        "#1381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-12",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The trigger is STARTING WORK, not claiming — and that distinction cost a merge",
      "prov:value": "Keyed on a bean id it finds nothing when the work has no bean of its own, which was this case — the sibling's bean (`0xfe`) existed only on an unpushed branch. **Search the subject as well as the id**: the file you are about to edit, the gate you are about to turn green, the symbol you are about to add. #1381's title said *\"Record the 25 uncatalogued translations\"*; nothing about `tuvg` would have matched it, and `UNCATALOGED` would have.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "`0xfe`",
        "`tuvg`",
        "#1381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-13",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "The trigger is STARTING WORK, not claiming — and that distinction cost a merge",
      "prov:value": "**Starting any new unit of work runs the collision review in [`coordinate`](../../../sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/coordinate.md) §\"Starting new work\"**, scaled to its blast radius and recorded in the workplan bean before the first edit (owner, 2026-10-02, #1885).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "owner",
        "#1885",
        "2026-10-02"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-14",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "And ASK AGAIN before you open the PR — looking once is not enough",
      "prov:value": "**Owner decision, 2026-09-26, bean `dx5j`.** That is the wrong and only moment they cover, and the gap it leaves was measured: **four duplicate-work collisions in one working window.**",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `dx5j`",
        "Owner",
        "2026-09-26"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-15",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "And ASK AGAIN before you open the PR — looking once is not enough",
      "prov:value": "The owner was offered three structural alternatives and rejected each for a stated reason, recorded here so nobody re-proposes one as new:",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "owner"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-16",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "`bun run cat beans:claim <id>` closes it — when the remote lets it",
      "prov:value": "Chosen by the owner over the PR-list check above, on the stated cost: a session writes to the default branch for claims, which this repository otherwise routes through pull requests.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "owner"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-17",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "`bun run cat beans:claim <id>` closes it — when the remote lets it",
      "prov:value": "A bean store exists at every checkout, so a claim run from the wrong one used to succeed silently, record that tree's branch as the holder, and leave the status edit there as stray dirt (bean `ssfp`, measured on a delegated agent whose worktree held the work while the claim landed in the main checkout).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `ssfp`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-18",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "`bun run cat beans:claim <id>` closes it — when the remote lets it",
      "prov:value": "**`held-unknown` is the case the store is mostly made of, and it used to be silent.** That arm returned `pushed` until bean `c3d7` — `heldBy === branch || heldBy === undefined`, on the reading that both mean \"ours, idempotent\".",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `c3d7`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-19",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "`bun run cat beans:claim <id>` closes it — when the remote lets it",
      "prov:value": "Measured on `origin/main` 2026-09-25: of the **100** non-epic beans marked `in-progress`, **97 record no holder** — because `todo-manager.md` and `session-intent.md` told an agent to claim with `beans update <id> --status in-progress`, which writes no note.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-25"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-20",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The measurement",
      "prov:value": "2026-09-19, bean `plj1` (`docs-site.yml`'s full-replace publish deleting every open PR's `branches/` preview). Two sessions set it `in-progress` **61 seconds apart** — 09:28:18Z and 09:29:19Z — and opened two PRs for it, #377 and #379, at ~09:36 and 09:37. Same diagnosis, same design choice, two implementations; #379 was withdrawn.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `plj1`",
        "#377",
        "#379",
        "2026-09-19"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-21",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The measurement",
      "prov:value": "(bean `nytj`, via a sidecar's recorded auditor hash).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `nytj`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-22",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The measurement",
      "prov:value": "Bean `35nj` records the options for narrowing the window — a wording fix, a direct claim push to the default branch, a PR-list check at claim time, or accepting it — none implemented.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "Bean `35nj`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-23",
