      "cat-harness:section": "RE-MEASURED 2026-09-21: the listing works now, the messaging still does not",
      "prov:value": "| | 2026-09-20 | 2026-09-21 | |---|---|---| | listing siblings | only self | **eleven, with branch and task**",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-20",
