    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-42",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A quiet claim — what `in-progress` does NOT tell you",
      "prov:value": "**Measured 2026-09-20, bean `fgnw`.** 60 beans were `in-progress`; **43 had no change in a four-hour window**, and 38 of those were last touched by a single bulk move at 09:37.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `fgnw`",
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-43",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A stale claim is reset to `todo`, and the reset keeps the record",
      "prov:value": "**Measured in `qou` 2026-10-04: 567 of 584 `in-progress` beans had not been touched in more than 14 days** (bean `yr93`, issue #2106).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `yr93`",
        "#2106",
        "2026-10-04"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-44",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A stale claim is reset to `todo`, and the reset keeps the record",
      "prov:value": "**14 days is the `bean-stale-in-progress` threshold in `bun run cat health`, and deliberately so:** two thresholds for one question drift apart, and bean `qml5` measured the cost of a third (7 days) that could never fire. It never touches an epic whose children are moving (`thux`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `qml5`",
        "`thux`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-45",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The branch store is the one every sibling reads (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "**Measured 2026-09-20, bean `cvab`.** Before the state branch, branch `claude/sleepy-rubin-mr6kdu` (PR #477, 65 commits ahead, 1,937 files) carried the `kupb` epic and **12 of its 13 children**. A review of the store on `main` therefore saw **0 %** of the IRIS work plan, and a whole goal's workstream was invisible until somebody swept the branch by hand.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `cvab`",
        "`kupb`",
        "#477",
        "PR #477",
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/bean-coordination.md#provenance-46",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "The branch store is the one every sibling reads (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "(1) prevents the blindness; (2) catches the branches that were already open when (1) landed — including #477, whose 12 beans are still branch-only today.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#477"
      ]
    },
    {
